  "created": "2026-11-20T10:58:16.91Z",
  "description": "ExpertPdf RTF to PDF Converter converts RTF documents and strings to PDF, with page settings, headers and footers, fonts embedding and merging with existing PDF documents.\n\nThis package contains the library for .NET Framework 2.0 to 4.8.1. It is the build for 64-bit (x64) applications; for x86 and AnyCPU applications use ExpertPdf.RtfToPdf.\n\nFeatures\n- Convert RTF files and strings to PDF files, streams or byte arrays\n- Page size, orientation, margins, fit width or height\n- Headers and footers with page numbering\n- Embedded fonts, right to left text\n- Append existing PDF documents to the result",
  "iconFile": "images\\icon.jpg",
