  "releaseNotes": "Version 10.0: Document information (PdfDocumentInfo), passwords and permissions (PdfSecurityOptions), PDF/A-1b output (PdfStandardSubset). Version 10 is part of the ExpertPdf 22.0 release: it requires a version 10 license key.",
